{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_70NcXKG0703U8LZikQCkmwG4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have successfully completed the implementation of human input file support. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n## Summary\n\n### Created Files:\n1. **`tools/se3_tools/human_input.py`** - Core module for file-based human input handling with:\n   - `HumanInput` dataclass for representing input files\n   - `HumanInputStore` class for managing input files (parse, write response, archive)\n   - Support for Context, Request, and Response sections\n   - Multi-language support (English, Chinese, French headers)\n   - Meaningful response detection (excludes HTML comments and placeholders)\n\n2. **`tools/se3_tools/commands/human_input.py`** - CLI command implementation with:\n   - `se3 human-input --list` - List pending input files\n   - `se3 human-input --file <path>` - Read and process an input file\n   - `se3 human-input --read <id>` - Read a specific input by ID\n   - `se3 human-input template <title>` - Create a new input template\n   - `se3 human-input respond <id> <response>` - Write response and archive\n\n3. **`tests/test_human_input.py`** - Comprehensive test suite (21 tests)\n\n4. **`human-inputs/`** directory structure with `archive/` subdirectory\n\n### Modified Files:\n1. **`tools/se3_tools/cli.py`** - Registered the new `human-input` command\n2. **`tools/se3_tools/__init__.py`** - Bumped version to 2.5.0\n\n### File Format:\n```markdown\n# Human Input: {title}\n\n## Context\n{context provided by human}\n\n## Request\n{what the human wants the agent to do}\n\n## Response\n{agent fills this in}\n```\n\n### Verified:\n- All 21 new tests pass\n- All 42 human_input/human_calls tests pass\n- CLI commands work correctly for listing, creating, responding, and archiving"}],"model":"kimi-for-coding","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":73983,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"out